an  [Music]  have you found the bromance this week if  you haven't you can find the duo over by  the grotto on the east side of the map  they are no longer dancing or searching  or preparing to leave the island  this week they have found peace and  tranquility  i'm going to quickly retell their story  now skip forward to this time if you've  had enough of the bros backstory  back when season 4 kicked off we had  previously seen a war between midas and  his two factions  ghost and shadow each week the map  updated in some really  great ways to show shadow slowly winning  the war  before midas end game project of uh  breaking time and space  collapsed and both factions were reduced  to rubble somehow a single henchman from  each side  survived the tsunami and set up home at  retail row and the authority  respectively  then two months ago now they somehow  found each other  they both traveled to the same gas  station cafe and that's  when the magic happened even though if  we got too close they became aggressive  they had a truce moment something  clicked and they realized that there was  more to life than following midas and  his instructions  they became friends two weeks later the  duo now named bill and ted by the psg  community  stayed at the same hotel enjoying pool  parties band rehearsals  and murdering wolverines a fortnight  later the duo began looking for  something  first staying at the dam we were unsure  if they were searching for a new home  or maybe searching for midas and the  answers they deserve  by halloween the duo made it up to  sweaty sands and enjoyed dressing up  and the bromance blossomed even more  getting stronger every single week  this though was also the week that midas  returned to  fortnite but this was not the same midas  they remembered he was  undead we tried to bring them together  to see if there was some sort of bomb  there  but there isn't midas attempted to  recruit the henchmen  into his shadow realm force last update  the duo 